abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted, entirely digital engineering proof of concept linking spinal
  interface literature, synthetic motor-learning and physiological-control
  studies, reference electronics, parametric CAD, and reproducible results.
  Simulations do not establish biological or clinical effectiveness.
